<li>De musica (On Music, probably composed after the De arithmetica), based on a lost work by Nicomachus of Gerasa and on Ptolemy’s Harmonica.</li>
<li>Possibly a treatise on geometry, extant only in fragments</li>
</ul>
<dl>
<dt>Bidang logika</dt>
</dl>
<dl>
<dt>A) Terjemahan</dt>
