</ul>
<dl>
<dt>Makalah asli</dt>
</dl>
<ul>
<li>De divisione (515–520?)</li>
<li>De syllogismo cathegorico (505–506)</li>
<li>Introductio ad syllogismos cathegoricos (c. 523)</li>
